ttps://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commits/883aefaed771e51f340703377a9470dae0b8e910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:49:33Z","email":"devnegikec@gmail.com","name":"Devendra Negi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:49:33Z","email":"devnegikec@gmail.com","name":"Devendra Negi"},"message":"feat(railway): serve the admin SPA at admin.ciphercode.ai\n\nThe admin app is standalone (no module federation), so on its own hostname it is\nserved from the root. app.ciphercode.ai is named explicitly while keeping `_` as\nthe default server, so the Railway-generated domain continues to work unchanged.\n\nBoth custom domains attach to the same horizon-ui service; nginx selects the\nblock by Host header, so no extra Railway service is needed.\n\nVerified the default host is unaffected (/ = 200, /healthz = 200,\n/inventory/remoteEntry.js = 200, /admin/ = 200). Host-based routing itself can\nonly be verified once the app./admin. CNAMEs resolve.","tree":{"sha":"b57f2a86d103324ed8b9bb6a0c23500bbd895ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/git/trees/b57f2a86d103324ed8b9bb6a0c23500bbd895ba7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/git/commits/883aefaed771e51f340703377a9470dae0b8e910","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/335388?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devnegikec","id":335388,"login":"devnegikec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTM4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commit/883aefaed771e51f340703377a9470dae0b8e910","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9n9h9oAKDg4M2FlZmFlZDc3MWU1MWYzNDA3MDMzNzdhOTQ3MGRhZTBiOGU5MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commit/ae5fdebde3c0f519ca2761a8c5fc74cf7137260a","sha":"ae5fdebde3c0f519ca2761a8c5fc74cf7137260a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commits/ae5fdebde3c0f519ca2761a8c5fc74cf7137260a"}],"sha":"883aefaed771e51f340703377a9470dae0b8e910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commits/883aefaed771e51f340703377a9470dae0b8e910"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/335388?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/devnegikec","id":335388,"login":"devnegikec","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTM4OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/commits/ae5fdebde3c0f519ca2761a8c5fc74cf7137260a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:39:50Z","email":"devnegikec@gmail.com","name":"Devendra Negi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:39:50Z","email":"devnegikec@gmail.com","name":"Devendra Negi"},"message":"fix(railway): serve the platform shell for /inventory SPA routes\n\napps/platform/src/app/AppRoutes.tsx mounts the inventory remote at exactly\n/inventory, and topbar links to /inventory/items/:id. The previous nginx block\nmatched the /inventory/ prefix and served the REMOTE''s own index.html, which is\nbuilt with baseHref \"/\" and therefore requests its assets from the site root\n(404) - a broken page.\n\nBoth exact paths are now served explicitly, because the remote''s files live in a\nreal directory: nginx would otherwise auto-301 /inventory -> /inventory/, which\ncombined with a redirect back caused an infinite loop.\n\nOnly real static files (remoteEntry.js + the remote''s chunks) come from the\ninventory build; every other /inventory/* path falls back to the platform shell.\n\nVerified: /inventory 200, /inventory/ 200, /inventory/items/123 200,\n/inventory/remoteEntry.js 200 application/javascript, 0 redirects.","tree":{"sha":"ddf2c383f507edfba33f0a9534c2d089b2532601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/git/trees/ddf2c383f507edfba33f0a9534c2d089b2532601"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/devnegikec/horizon-sync/git/commits/ae5fdebde3c0f519ca2761a8c5fc74cf7137260a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/335388?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devnegikec/gists{/gist_id}","gravat