ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T09:23:34Z","email":"bernardo.trindade-de-abreu@ustwo.com","name":"Bernardo T. Abreu"},"message":"fix(mcp): use official MCP SDK transports for Cursor compatibility\n\n- Replace custom SSE handler with official SSEServerTransport\n- Add StreamableHTTPServerTransport for modern MCP protocol\n- Separate /sse (SSE stream) and /messages (POST endpoint) per MCP spec\n- Add /mcp endpoint for Streamable HTTP transport\n- Update Caddyfile with proper SSE streaming config (flush_interval -1)\n- Add mcp-session-id header support for Streamable HTTP\n- Update CORS headers to include DELETE and expose mcp-session-id\n\nThe custom SSE implementation was sending JSON messages that weren''t\nvalid JSON-RPC (e.g., {type: ''ping'', connectionId: ''...''} instead of\nproper JSON-RPC 2.0 format). Using the official SDK transports fixes\nthis compatibility issue with Cursor IDE.","tree":{"sha":"cdefc8d793436a8ff5fccbb69679e9f1d7e38915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poc-micro-frontends/terraform-infrastructure/git/trees/cdefc8d793436a8ff5fccbb69679e9f1d7e38915"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/poc-micro-frontends/terraform-infrastructure/git/commits/2b836b6290b51cc25eee884c983b247eb79d53bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13338262?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berTrindade","id":13338262,"login":"berTrindade","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzM4MjYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berTrindade/received_even