.github.com/users/zizu28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/commits/6cad304a228b4c2422cd8167b34fad7a9d84fb00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:18:15Z","email":"91533902+zizu28@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zizu28"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:18:15Z","email":"91533902+zizu28@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zizu28"},"message":"Add tests, refactor structure, unify SMS/email services\n\n- Added integration and unit test projects for Messaging and Bookings modules, including command/event handler tests.\n- Refactored solution structure to nest test projects under module folders.\n- Updated test project references to correct relative paths.\n- Introduced shared ISmsService abstraction and mock, with DI extensions.\n- Registered shared SMS services in app startup; replaced Messaging-specific registrations.\n- Updated event handlers to use shared email/SMS abstractions.\n- Removed Messaging-specific IEmailService/ISmsService and mocks.\n- Enabled InternalsVisibleTo for Messaging.Application unit tests.\n- Added integration tests using Testcontainers for SQL Server.\n- Added unit tests for command/event handlers with Moq and FluentAssertions.","tree":{"sha":"96a48558d2a499bb77d934a49495a231653dd20a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/trees/96a48558d2a499bb77d934a49495a231653dd20a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/commits/6cad304a228b4c2422cd8167b34fad7a9d84fb00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91533902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/events{/privac