.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/commits/6c55a3ea07afb814749c6f37c7c17df8f4b8a177/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T05:07:46Z","email":"91533902+zizu28@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zizu28"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T05:07:46Z","email":"91533902+zizu28@users.noreply.github.com","name":"zizu28"},"message":"Add social auth, improve auth flow, and navigation updates\n\n- Added Google and Microsoft social authentication services and DI registration\n- Updated FacebookAuthService to skip token validation if not configured\n- Refactored AuthController: added logging, better error handling, switched to \"ExternalCookie\" scheme\n- Made social login flow async in client; backend now provides redirect URL\n- Updated Login.razor to use async social login\n- Added breadcrumbs to MyBookings and PropertyDetails pages\n- Changed main layout to show user name and logout button\n- JWT generation now uses Issuer/Audience from config with defaults\n- Fixed SQL syntax in UserRepository and improved update queries\n- Updated project references for modular monolith loading\n- Program.cs now loads API assemblies dynamically\n- Added CheckDb and CheckUsers utilities using ADO.NET\n- Added System.Data.SqlClient package and JWT config section\n- Minor authentication and navigation improvements","tree":{"sha":"91c29dd8e74f600aa79f359b389397dbcd513de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/trees/91c29dd8e74f600aa79f359b389397dbcd513de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/commits/6c55a3ea07afb814749c6f37c7c17df8f4b8a177","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91533902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/following{/other_user}","gists_