 Architecture and DDD\n\n- Created solution with 39 projects (8 modules, 4 shared projects, Host, API Gateway, BFF)\n- Implemented shared base classes in Shared.Abstractions:\n  * Domain primitives: Entity<TId>, AggregateRoot<TId>, ValueObject, DomainEvent\n  * Result pattern for error handling: Result<T>, Error\n  * Repository interfaces: IRepository, IUnitOfWork\n  * Messaging interfaces: IIntegrationEvent, IEventBus\n- Implemented shared value objects in Shared.Kernel:\n  * Money with currency support (GHS, USD, EUR, GBP)\n  * Address for physical addresses\n  * GpsCoordinates with distance calculation\n  * DateRange with overlap detection\n- Added configuration files:\n  * Directory.Build.props for common project settings\n  * global.json for SDK version\n  * .editorconfig for code style\n  * .gitignore for build artifacts\n  * README.md with project overview\n- All 39 projects build successfully\n- Architecture: Modular Monolith with Clean Architecture + DDD principles","tree":{"sha":"e241c92ccf907e15a7548f9d8615c5a660d533ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/trees/e241c92ccf907e15a7548f9d8615c5a660d533ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zizu28/RentIt/git/commits/c96d5c86347e8b50e59086735dc4d7458c7fbedc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91533902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zizu28","id":91533902,"login":"zizu28","node_id":"U_kgDOBXSyTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zizu28/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.c