_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/commits/e7e57c4ef62d87f2b993b89c9736f49b566cd561/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:31:59Z","email":"mehmet@celik.be","name":"Mehmet Celik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:31:59Z","email":"mehmet@celik.be","name":"Mehmet Celik"},"message":"Build releases on Node 22\n\nNode 20 is end-of-life and GitHub has deprecated it on the runners, which\nwarns on every run:\n\n  Node.js 20 is deprecated. The following actions target Node.js 20 but are\n  being forced to run on Node.js 24\n\n22 is the current LTS. Verified by rebuilding the 2026.9.1 tarball on Node\n22.15.0 from a clean `npm ci`: sha256 a11d4036... — byte-for-byte identical\nto what CI produced on Node 20, so the bump changes no shipped output.","tree":{"sha":"9182c077be680333b6b7e69f76022eb443da605d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/git/trees/9182c077be680333b6b7e69f76022eb443da605d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/git/commits/e7e57c4ef62d87f2b993b89c9736f49b566cd561","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetc","id":13090,"login":"mehmetc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/libis/primo-shared-state/commit/e7e57c4ef62d87f2b993b89c9736f49b566cd561","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-IcdNoAKGU3ZTU3YzRlZjYyZDg3ZjJiOTkzYjg5Yzk3MzZmNDliNTY2Y2Q1NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/libis/primo-shared-state/commit/524c6b63a52cac7919cd5cfe50f6738ddd9050c4","sha":"524c6b63a52cac7919cd5cfe50f6738ddd9050c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/commits/524c6b63a52cac7919cd5cfe50f6738ddd9050c4"}],"sha":"e7e57c4ef62d87f2b993b89c9736f49b566cd561","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/commits/e7e57c4ef62d87f2b993b89c9736f49b566cd561"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetc","id":13090,"login":"mehmetc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/commits/524c6b63a52cac7919cd5cfe50f6738ddd9050c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:24:41Z","email":"mehmet@celik.be","name":"Mehmet Celik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T11:24:41Z","email":"mehmet@celik.be","name":"Mehmet Celik"},"message":"Attach tarball when the release already exists\n\n`gh release edit` does not touch assets, so when the release job took the\n\"already exists\" branch the tarball was never uploaded. That branch is\nreached whenever the release is published from the GitHub UI: publishing a\ndraft creates the tag, and that tag push is what triggers this workflow, so\nthe release always pre-exists the run.\n\n2026.9.1 hit exactly this and shipped with zero assets while the run stayed\ngreen.\n\n- upload the tarball explicitly in the \"already exists\" branch\n  (`gh release upload --clobber`)\n- add a Verify release asset step so a run cannot go green while the\n  release has no tarball attached","tree":{"sha":"0b4295c4c257d12162c3131f5df27d73f48f4fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/git/trees/0b4295c4c257d12162c3131f5df27d73f48f4fda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/libis/primo-shared-state/git/commits/524c6b63a52cac7919cd5cfe50f6738ddd9050c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13090?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetc","id":13090,"login":"mehmetc","node_id"