","email":"p.e.lezhenin@gmail.com","name":"Pavel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T22:56:51Z","email":"p.e.lezhenin@gmail.com","name":"Pavel"},"message":"refactor(docs): separate framework-specific patterns from general concepts\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Documentation structure reorganized\n\n- Move REACT.md and ANGULAR.md to framework/{react,angular}/README.md\n- Create framework-specific pattern files in docs/framework/{react,angular}/patterns/\n- Update general pattern files to contain only concepts with links to implementations\n\nNew structure:\n- docs/patterns/*.md - Framework-agnostic concepts and principles\n- docs/framework/react/patterns/*.md - React-specific implementations\n- docs/framework/angular/patterns/*.md - Angular-specific implementations\n\nPatterns split:\n- ROUTING: concepts vs React Router / Angular Router\n- STATE_MANAGEMENT: concepts vs Zustand / Signals\n- FORMS: concepts vs React Hook Form / Reactive Forms\n- AUTHENTICATION: concepts vs Context+Guards / Signals+Functional Guards\n- ERROR_HANDLING: concepts vs Error Boundaries / HttpInterceptor\n- PERFORMANCE: concepts vs memo+useMemo / OnPush+defer\n- ACCESSIBILITY: concepts vs focus-trap / CDK A11y\n- API_MOCKING: concepts vs MSW+TanStack / MSW+HttpClient","tree":{"sha":"ff60b49e5b0cd4fb7e2e6716a9c6c43a87168146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pavel-lezhenin/front-templates/git/trees/ff60b49e5b0cd4fb7e2e6716a9c6c43a87168146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pavel-lezhenin/front-templates/git/commits/5499ea7d8a533ba055de825cb88746879e78a9c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39806762?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-lezhenin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-lezhenin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavel-lezhenin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht