o}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/commits/ea5e57c153e28d69d0f83b0cbb22e8e3a45beca5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T11:47:11Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T11:47:11Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"message":"fix: resolve bot bugs and add Mattermost integration\n\nBug fixes:\n- Fix procurement creation: use organizer_id (not organizer) and set dynamic deadline (90d from now, was hardcoded expired date)\n- Fix validate_name regex to allow mixed Russian/Latin names and hyphens\n- Fix get_status_emoji: replace empty string values with actual Unicode emoji\n- Remove unused `from enum import Enum` import in registration.py\n\nNew Mattermost adapter (groupbuy-bot/adapters/mattermost/):\n- Webhook endpoint receives outgoing webhooks / slash commands from Mattermost\n- Routes messages to bot service HTTP endpoint\n- Can send messages and DMs back via Mattermost Bot API\n\nNew HTTP server on bot service (port 8001):\n- Receives platform-agnostic messages from adapters (Mattermost, etc.)\n- message_processor.py handles multi-platform command dispatch\n- Bot still works standalone via Telegram polling (TELEGRAM_TOKEN optional)\n\nNew Rust API endpoints:\n- GET /api/procurements/user/{user_id}/ - user''s organized + participating procurements\n- POST /api/procurements/{id}/check_access/ - access control for chat\n- POST /api/procurements/{id}/leave/ - properly deactivates participant record\n- GET /api/chat/messages/unread_count/ - count unread messages for user\n\nDatabase migration:\n- 002: add UNIQUE constraint on user_sessions.user_id (fixes upsert)\n\nDeployment:\n- docker-compose.yml: added mattermost-adapter, websocket-server services\n- TELEGRAM_TOKEN now optional (Telegram profile optional via ''telegram'' compose profile)\n- .env.example updated with all Mattermost variables documented\n- One-command deployment: `cp .env.example .env && docker-compose up -d`\n\nTests:\n- Add tests/conftest.py to fix sys.path for bot module imports\n- All 14 existing tests now pass\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23a3c70aada7944084442c369f08a6409b187993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/git/trees/23a3c70aada7944084442c369f08a6409b187993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/git/commits/ea5e57c153e28d69d0f83b0cbb22e8e3a45beca5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","id":1431904,"login":"konard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MixaByk1996/mattermost/commit/ea5e57c153e28d69d0f83b0cbb22e8e3a45beca5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-z_VtoAKGVhNWU1N2MxNTNlMjhkNjlkMGY4M2IwY2JiMjJlOGUzYTQ1YmVjYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MixaByk1996/mattermost/commit/f0cdda2727f43d0bb3a86a164729867f7dfb92c2","sha":"f0cdda2727f43d0bb3a86a164729867