b.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","id":1431904,"login":"konard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/commits/48e57b2bcb456f5259faf614955341afac9683f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T12:08:03Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T12:08:03Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"message":"feat: Rewrite backend to Rust with Actix-web and add WASM utils\n\nImplements the complete backend API in Rust replacing the Python/Django\nbackend as requested. Also adds a Rust+WebAssembly utility module for\nclient-side validation and formatting logic.\n\nRust Backend (core-rust):\n- Actix-web 4 HTTP framework with async handlers\n- SQLx for PostgreSQL database access\n- Full REST API matching existing Django endpoints:\n  - Users: CRUD, by_platform, check_exists, balance, role, sessions\n  - Procurements: CRUD, join, leave, categories\n  - Payments: create, status\n  - Chat: messages, notifications\n- WebSocket server for real-time chat (broadcast-based)\n- Database migrations (001_initial.sql)\n- Docker multi-stage build for production\n- CORS, tracing/logging, environment configuration\n\nWASM Utils (wasm-utils):\n- Phone and email validation\n- Procurement progress calculation\n- Currency formatting (Russian rubles)\n- Relative time formatting (Russian)\n- Procurement form validation\n- Platform user ID generation\n\nCo-Authored-By: 