riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/commits/441f4688ddc3a600a507eb210db6c3417468e80a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-25T13:01:34Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-25T13:01:34Z","email":"drakonard@gmail.com","name":"konard"},"message":"feat: Implement GroupBuy Bot for multi-platform group purchasing\n\nThis commit implements a complete multi-platform group purchasing bot\nbased on the technical specification in task.docx.\n\n## Features implemented:\n\n### Core API (Django)\n- User management with 3 roles: Buyer, Organizer, Supplier\n- Procurement system for group purchases\n- Real-time chat system for procurement communications\n- Payment integration with YooKassa\n\n### Bot Service (Telegram)\n- Registration dialog with validation\n- Procurement browsing and creation\n- Balance management and deposits\n- Profile management\n\n### Infrastructure\n- WebSocket server for real-time chat\n- Docker Compose for development and production\n- Nginx configuration for reverse proxy\n- Redis for caching and message queues\n\n### Tests\n- Unit tests for bot commands\n- API tests for core endpoints\n\nFixes MixaByk1996/mattermost#1\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"874e293e5c1b0486f6beb22310c21573a1940952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/git/trees/874e293e5c1b0486f6beb22310c21573a1940952"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MixaByk1996/mattermost/git/commits/441f4688ddc3a600a507eb210db6c3417468e80a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","followe