":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/79a1b7b1d3d873d854058bdb4b77808f7207bee2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T13:38:21Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T13:38:21Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"fix: Fix import.meta usage in transport for Jest compatibility\n\nThe analytics transport was using import.meta.env which caused Jest tests to fail\nwith ''Cannot use import.meta outside a module'' error.\n\nFixed by:\n- Checking process.env first (Jest/Node environment)\n- Using eval() to access import.meta in Vite runtime (avoids Jest parse error)\n- Proper fallbacks for both environments\n\nThis fixes the test failures and restores test coverage.\n\nChanges:\n- src/analytics/transport.ts: Updated getAnalyticsServiceUrl and getAnalyticsWriteKey\n  to work in both Jest and Vite environments","tree":{"sha":"b2167346d80658762d16fe7858cbd42d9e1fdc0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/b2167346d80658762d16fe7858cbd42d9e1fdc0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/79a1b7b1d3d873d854058bdb4b77808f7207bee2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/79a1b7b1d3d873d854058bdb4b77808f7207bee2","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDc5YTFiN2IxZDNkODczZDg1NDA1OGJkYjRiNzc4MDhmNzIwN2JlZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b","sha":"985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b"}],"sha":"79a1b7b1d3d873d854058bdb4b77808f7207bee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/79a1b7b1d3d873d854058bdb4b77808f7207bee2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:28:00Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:28:00Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Add Azure Key Vault integration for analytics write key\n\nUpdated GitHub Actions deployment workflow to automatically retrieve\nthe analytics write key from Azure Key Vault during build.\n\nChanges:\n- .github/workflows/deploy.yml:\n  - Added Azure login step before building Docker image\n  - Added step to retrieve analytics-write-key from Key Vault\n  - Masked the write key in logs for security\n  - Set analytics service URL based on environment (dev/staging/prod)\n  - Added VITE_ANALYTICS_SERVICE_URL and VITE_ANALYTICS_WRITE_KEY as build args\n\nSecurity:\n- Write key is retrieved from Key Vault at build time\n- Key is automatically masked in GitHub Actions logs\n- No secrets committed to source control\n\nEnvironment-specific analytics URLs:\n- dev: https://analytics-service-func-dev.azurewebsites.net\n- staging: https://analytics-service-func-staging.azurewebsites.net\n- prod: https://analytics-service-func-prod.azurewebsites.net\n\nRequirements:\n- AZURE_KEYVAULT_NAME secret must be configured in GitHub\n- analytics-write-key secret must exist in the Key Vault\n- Service principal must have Key Vault Secrets User role","tree":{"sha":"91f43aa58b9a04b9d8b170e0279643f34af2f51b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/91f43aa58b9a04b9d8b170e0279643f34af2f51b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDk4NWVkZTRmNDJmOWFlMDI4ODYwYjI2NDgwOWYzMzE1OWNiNTgxNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815","sha":"889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815"}],"sha":"985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/985ede4f42f9ae028860b264809f33159cb5816b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:22:44Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T12:22:44Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"docs: Update analytics config for Azure Key Vault and correct service URL\n\nUpdated analytics configuration to use:\n1. Correct Azure Functions endpoint: analytics-service-func-dev.azurewebsites.net\n2. Azure Key Vault for write key management (security best practice)\n\nChanges:\n- .env.example: Updated with correct service URL and Key Vault instructions\n- .env.development: Updated with correct service URL and Key Vault CLI command\n- docs/ANALYTICS_DEPLOYMENT.md: New deployment guide with:\n  - Environment variable configuration\n  - Azure Key Vault integration options\n  - GitHub Actions workflow example\n  - Local development setup\n  - Troubleshooting guide\n\nSecurity:\n- Write key should never be committed to source control\n- Use Key Vault secret references in Container Apps\n- Or retrieve from Key Vault in CI/CD pipeline\n\nNext steps:\n- Configure Key Vault secret reference in Azure Container Apps\n- Or update GitHub Actions workflow to retrieve from Key Vault","tree":{"sha":"626f70447136fd2764d08e4d6d7bb3d8f2d41283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/626f70447136fd2764d08e4d6d7bb3d8f2d41283"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/889c30a932e1e3a631c6bfd325cedb6444f3a815","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDg4OWMzMGE5MzJlMWUzYTYzMWM2YmZkMzI1Y2VkYjY0NDRmM2E4MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/5791d8577bed661081c7b9f7367ead2a381d6bd5","sha":"5791d8577bed661081c7b9f7367ead2a381d6bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/5791d8577bed661081c7b9f7367ead2a