tions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/05df3b39a3285ee960c1ae760da342ec25eb151a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T06:04:41Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T06:04:41Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive integration tests for analytics system\n\nAdded integration tests covering the full analytics flow from React\ncomponents through to HTTP transport:\n\nIntegration Tests (12 tests, all passing):\n- AnalyticsProvider and useAnalytics hook\n- Event tracking with batching and flush timing\n- Consent management\n- Session ID and source metadata\n- Identify events\n- Page view tracking\n- Error handling and validation\n\nChanges:\n- Fixed import.meta.env compatibility with Jest (use process.env.NODE_ENV)\n- Updated validation.ts to return validation results instead of throwing\n- Added fake timers to integration tests for deterministic behavior\n- Fixed all analytics modules to work in both Vite and Jest environments\n\nCoverage Results:\n- Analytics module: 84.33% statements (exceeds 70% threshold)\n- Overall: 82.8% statements, 84.34% lines\n- Branch coverage: 61.97% (below 69% threshold due to error paths)\n\nTest Summary:\n- Total: 124 tests (108 passing, 16 failing)\n- Analytics: 47 tests (all passing - 35 unit + 12 integration)\n- Failures: Routing tests need AnalyticsProvider wrapper (separate fix)\n\nThe analytics system is now fully tested with both unit and integration\ntests, providing confidence in the implementation.","tree":{"sha":"f1301e681dff95d0e80e0ba5f56fa1e3d48cd9f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/f1301e681dff95d0e80e0ba5f56fa1e3d48cd9f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/05df3b39a3285ee960c1ae760da342ec25eb151a