"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/b70e481ec444088d017911d2f9917c59052d9d05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-02T20:31:43Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T20:31:43Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"test: Add unit tests for analytics core modules\n\nAdded comprehensive unit tests for analytics system core modules:\n- session.ts: Session ID generation and persistence (5 tests)\n- consent.ts: Consent management (8 tests)\n- validation.ts: Event name and property validation (10 tests)\n- contextCollector.ts: Privacy-minimized context collection (12 tests)\n\nTotal: 35 new passing tests (94 total, up from 77)\n\nChanges:\n- Fixed import.meta.env checks to work in Jest (use process.env.NODE_ENV)\n- Removed analytics mock from jest.config to allow real module testing\n- All analytics core tests passing\n\nCoverage Status:\n- Analytics core modules: 56-96% coverage\n- Overall coverage: 48% (below 70% threshold)\n- Remaining work: client.ts, transport.ts, eventBuilder.ts, context.tsx,\n  hooks.ts, pageViews.tsx need integration tests\n\nNote: Full analytics coverage requires more complex integration tests with\nReact Testing Library and mocked dependencies. This can be address