st Infrastructure:\n   - Removed global loader mock from jest.config.ts\n   - Added per-test-file mocks for loader in component/routing tests\n   - Loader tests now use real implementation (not mocked)\n   - All 70 tests now passing\n\n2. Test Files Updated:\n   - RemoteAppLoader.test.tsx: Added mock for loader\n   - shell-routing.test.tsx: Added mock for loader\n   - loader.test.ts: Uses real loader implementation\n   - remote-app-contract.test.ts: Uses real loader implementation\n\n3. Coverage Improvements:\n   - Statements: 63.86% → 83.16% ✅\n   - Branches: 40.42% → 70.21% ✅\n   - Functions: 56.6% → 81.13% ✅\n   - Lines: 64.97% → 83.75% ✅\n\nAll coverage thresholds now met (>70% required).\n\nTest Results:\n✅ Test Suites: 12 passed, 12 total\n✅ Tests: 70 passed, 70 total\n✅ All coverage thresholds met\n\nThe loader is now properly tested with its real implementation,\nwhile component tests use mocks for fast, deterministic execution.","tree":{"sha":"b9d4e77441431d88289f31dae1804d663db5abc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/b9d4e77441431d88289f31dae1804d663db5abc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/1d94ab7531a60df3d568dbaa4ad3496880ebe670","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"ht