gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/2995a529c8c4751bebebcd076f03c133dd5aa842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T12:22:19Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T12:22:19Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Integrate real core app from Azure with dynamic loading\n\nReplace core app stub with real Azure-hosted remote app using dynamic loader.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. Environment Configuration:\n   - Added .env.development with Azure dev URL\n   - Added .env.staging with Azure staging URL\n   - Added .env.production with Azure prod URL\n   - Core app URL: https://ca-react-app-core-{env}.westeurope.azurecontainerapps.io/assets/remoteEntry.js\n\n2. RemoteAppLoader Component (new):\n   - Dynamically loads remote apps from configured URLs\n   - Falls back to stub if remote app fails to load\n   - Shows loading state during fetch\n   - Displays warning banner when using fallback stub\n   - Implements proper error handling and reporting\n\n3. App.tsx Updates:\n   - Core app now uses RemoteAppLoader instead of direct stub\n   - Campaigns app still uses stub directly (will be updated later)\n   - Maintains same routing structure\n\n4. Module Federation Integration:\n   - Remote name: remoteApp_core\n   - Exposed module: ./bootstrap\n   - Contract version: 1 (fully compliant)\n   - Shared dependencies: React 18.2.0 (singleton)\n\n5. Test Mocks:\n   - Added mock for loadRemoteApp to return stubs in tests\n   - Updated jest.config.ts to use loader mock\n   - Note: Some routing tests need async updates (TODO)\n\nBenefits:\n✅ Real core app loads from Azure in dev/staging/prod\n✅ Graceful fallback to stub if remote unavailable\n✅ Clear visual feedback during loading\n✅ No code changes needed for different environments\n✅ Maintains backward compatibility with stubs\n\nManual Testing:\n1. Run ''npm run dev'' - should load real core app from Azure\n2. If Azure is unavailable, shows warning and uses stub\n3. Check browser console for any loading errors\n\nTODO:\n- Update routing tests to handle async RemoteAppLoader\n- Add RemoteAppLoader tests\n- Consider similar integration for campaigns app","tree":{"sha":"ba8ee7beb69d4c00ff89542aed6d1c3246f6209a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/ba8ee7beb69d4c00ff89542aed6d1c3246f6209a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/2995a529c8c4751bebebcd076f03c133dd5aa842","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/2995a529c8c4751bebebcd076f03c133dd5aa842","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDI5OTVhNTI5YzhjNDc1MWJlYmViY2QwNzZmMDNjMTMzZGQ1YWE4NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5","sha":"a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5"}],"sha":"2995a529c8c4751bebebcd076f03c133dd5aa842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/2995a529c8c4751bebebcd076f03c133dd5aa842"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:34:33Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:34:33Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Improve blue/green deployment robustness in Stage 4\n\nImplement deterministic health checks, explicit failure reporting, and\naligned rollback behavior for more reliable deployments.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. Health Check Improvements:\n   - Changed to hit /health endpoint instead of root (/)\n   - /health endpoint provided by nginx config\n   - Reports HTTP status codes for better diagnostics\n   - Tracks failure state for detailed reporting\n\n2. Explicit Failure Summary:\n   - New ''Deployment failure summary'' step identifies what failed\n   - Distinguishes between health check, smoke test, and traffic switch failures\n   - Shows deployment state (GREEN deployed but not live, BLUE status)\n   - Clear, structured output with failure analysis\n\n3. Enhanced Rollback Reporting:\n   - Detailed rollback status reporting (SUCCESS/SKIPPED/FAILED)\n   - Shows traffic distribution after rollback\n   - Notes that failed GREEN remains at 0% for debugging\n   - Explicit manual intervention message if rollback fails\n   - Clear state information for troubleshooting\n\n4. Label-Based Rollback Alignment:\n   - Updated rollback script to use label-based switching\n   - Consistent with forward deployment (switch script)\n   - Determines labels from revision names automatically\n   - More reliable and predictable behavior\n\nBenefits:\n✅ Deterministic health checks against proper endpoint\n✅ Clear failure reporting shows exactly what went wrong\n✅ Rollback behavior aligned with deployment strategy\n✅ Easy to reason about deployment state at any point\n✅ Better debugging information when failures occur\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ Stage 4 tests are deterministic (health check hits /health)\n✅ Failures are clearly reported with context\n✅ Rollback is reliable and uses label-based switching","tree":{"sha":"e2a6e3b4b45a8883495a32c28715168f5e161577","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/e2a6e3b4b45a8883495a32c28715168f5e161577"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKGE4OWViNzAyZWRjMzIyZTFjOGQ1YTQ4ZDJmOGU1OGY2MzA4NzRiZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/fc3fa500734c369a19d55e86734bace4edc32aa6","sha":"fc3fa500734c369a19d55e86734bace4edc32aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/fc3fa500734c369a19d55e86734bace4edc32aa6"}],"sha":"a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/a89eb702edc322e1c8d5a48d2f8e58f630874bf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/fc3fa500734c369a19d55e86734bace4edc32aa6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:31:40Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:31:40Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Implement robust Stage 3→4 artifact contract for deploy outputs\n\nImplement explicit deploy outputs contract (v1.0.0) to ensure Stage 4\nnever relies on job outputs or re-discovery of deployment state.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. Contract Documentation:\n   - Added scripts/ci/DEPLOY_OUTPUTS_CONTRACT.md with full specification\n   - Updated .github/workflows/README.md with contract overview\n   - Defined required fields: GREEN_URL, GREEN_ID, BLUE_ID, ACTIVE_URL\n   - Defined optional fields: IMAGE_REF, COMMIT_SHA, ENVIRONMENT, DEPLOYED_AT\n\n2. Deploy Script (scripts/ci/deploy-azure-green.sh):\n   - Added early validation of required outputs before writing artifact\n   - Fails fast if GREEN_ID, GREEN_URL, or ACTIVE_URL cannot be determined\n   - Includes optional fields (IMAGE_REF, COMMIT_SHA, ENVIRONMENT, DEPLOYED_AT)\n   - Enhanced logging to show contract version and all fields\n   - No secrets ever written to artifact file\n\n3. Workflow Changes (.github/workflows/deploy.yml):\n   - Removed job outputs from deploy_azure stage (Stage 3)\n   - Added contract validation in verify_switch_azure stage (Stage 4)\n   - Stage 4 validates all required fields before proceeding\n   - Fails fast with clear error if contract is invalid\n   - Pass GITHUB_SHA to deploy script for COMMIT_SHA field\n\nContract Guarantees:\n\nStage 3:\n✅ Always produces artifact with all required fields\n✅ Fails early if required info unavailable\n✅ Never includes secrets in artifact\n✅ Validates outputs before upload\n\nStage 4:\n✅ Only uses artifact (no job outputs or re-discovery)\n✅ Validates contract before proceeding\n✅ Fails fast with clear errors if invalid\n\nSecurity:\n✅ No secrets (REGISTRY_PASSWORD, tokens) in logs or artifact\n✅ Only deployment metadata in deploy-outputs.env\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ Stage 4 never relies on job outputs or re-discovery\n✅ Artifact contract explicitly documented and stable\n✅ Deploy script always produces file or fails early\n✅ No secrets printed to logs","tree":{"sha":"c74b3f06c32025dc7118a424554eac22442d04e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/c74b3f06c32025dc7118a424554eac22442d04e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/fc3fa500734c369a19d55e86734bace4edc32aa6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gist