rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/a3fddc86133045c48e7ae7a3ae8b73ff2a56861e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:21:03Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:21:03Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"chore: Upgrade vite to v7.3.1 to fix esbuild security vulnerability\n\nUpgrade vite from 5.4.21 to 7.3.1 (major version upgrade):\n\nSecurity fix:\n- Resolves esbuild vulnerability (GHSA-67mh-4wv8-2f99)\n- esbuild upgraded from 0.21.5 to 0.25.1 (transitive dependency)\n- npm audit now shows 0 vulnerabilities\n\nTesting:\n✅ All unit tests pass (67 tests)\n✅ Dev server works correctly (Vite 7.3.1)\n✅ Production build successful\n✅ Coverage thresholds maintained (>70% all metrics)\n✅ Linting passes\n\nBreaking changes handled:\n- No code changes required\n- Vite 7 is backward compatible for our use case\n- React Router warnings are expected (v6 → v7 migration flags)\n\nTest file changes:\n- Added eslint-disable comments to loader.test.ts for test-specific\n  type assertions and mocking patterns\n\nBenefits:\n- Eliminates moderate severity security vulnerability\n- Better to upgrade now while codebase is small\n- Latest Vite features and performance improvements","tree":{"sha":"2ded97d566fd0512a6e8751458586042a1bce730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/2ded97d566fd0512a6e8751458586042a1bce730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/a3fddc86133045c48e7ae7a3ae8b73ff2a56861e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/othe