e_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/6ad018cb1ce9b710fb2880fcb1b7e94c7c3cf29b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:04:22Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:10:37Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"test: Add comprehensive tests to meet 70% coverage threshold\n\nAdd tests for previously uncovered code paths:\n\nNew test files:\n- tests/unit/lib/error-reporter.test.ts\n  - Tests for NoOpErrorReporter and ConsoleErrorReporter\n  - Tests for setErrorReporter and global functions\n  - Covers all error reporting scenarios\n\n- tests/unit/pages/NotFoundPage.test.tsx\n  - Tests for 404 page rendering\n  - Tests for navigation links\n  - 100% coverage for NotFoundPage\n\n- tests/unit/components/RemoteAppErrorBoundary.test.tsx\n  - Tests for error boundary behavior\n  - Tests for error UI rendering\n  - Tests for reload functionality\n  - 100% coverage for error boundary\n\n- tests/unit/lib/remote-app-contract/loader.test.ts\n  - Comprehensive tests for remote app loading\n  - Tests for retry logic, timeout, validation\n  - Tests for all error paths and contract validation\n  - 100% coverage for loader\n\n- tests/unit/components/RemoteAppMount.test.tsx\n  - Tests for mount/unmount lifecycle\n  - Tests for error handling\n  - Tests for cleanup behavior\n\nJest config changes:\n- Exclude src/stubs/** from coverage (temporary dev aids)\n\nCoverage results (all thresholds met):\n✅ Statements: 85.2% (threshold: 70%)\n✅ Branches: 73.17% (threshold: 70%)\n✅ Functions: 81.63% (threshold: 70%)\n✅ Lines: 85.97% (threshold: 70%)\n\nThis ensures deploy pipeline Stage 1 quality gates 