hor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/97517c65430d293f73168232a37b047bd6d696bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T07:55:33Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T07:55:33Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Add quality gates to deploy pipeline Stage 1\n\nAdd mandatory quality gates to deploy pipeline that match/exceed PR checks:\n\nStage 1 Quality Gates (3 parallel jobs):\n1. test: Test & Quality Checks\n   - Type checking, linting, formatting\n   - Unit tests with coverage (enforces 70% threshold)\n   - Integration tests\n   - Build validation\n\n2. codeql: CodeQL Security Scan\n   - JavaScript/TypeScript static analysis\n   - Security-and-quality query suite\n   - Blocks deployment on security issues\n\n3. audit: Dependency Audit\n   - npm audit with moderate severity threshold\n   - Fails on vulnerable dependencies\n\nStage 2 Dependencies:\n- Build job now depends on: [context, test, codeql, audit]\n- Cannot proceed without passing all Stage 1 gates\n\nPolicy Decisions:\n- npm audit level: moderate (same as ci.yml)\n- Coverage threshold: 70% (enforced via jest.config.ts)\n- CodeQL queries: security-and-quality\n\nBenefits:\n- Deploy pipeline gates >= PR gates (no weaker checks)\n- Parallel execution for faster feedback\n- Clear separation of concerns (test/security/dependencies)\n- Coverage enforcement prevents quality regression\n- Follows MACH security-first principles\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ Deploy pipeline cannot proceed without passing CodeQL\n✅ Deploy pipeline cannot proceed without passing npm audit\n✅ Deploy pipeline cannot proceed without coverage-enforced tests\n✅ Stage 2 depends on all Stage 1 checks\n✅ Deploy gates not weaker than PR gates","tree":{"sha":"79b4e22b4a03ad59e64cd6bc7ce3e154f9477afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/79b4e22b4a03ad59e64cd6bc7ce3e154f9477afa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/97517c65430d293f73168232a37b047bd6d696bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscripti