":{"date":"2026-01-27T07:54:03Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"feat: Configure dev-only error reporting in main.tsx\n\nConfigure error reporter to log to console in development only:\n- Import setErrorReporter and ConsoleErrorReporter\n- Check import.meta.env.DEV to conditionally enable console logging\n- In dev: remote loading failures are visible in console\n- In prod: remains no-op (no console output)\n\nBenefits:\n- Developers can see remote loading failures during development\n- Production builds remain clean (no console pollution)\n- ESLint no-console rule satisfied (uses error-reporter abstraction)\n- Follows existing error-reporter pattern\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ In dev: remote loading failures are visible\n✅ In prod: no console output emitted by default\n✅ ESLint no-console rule satisfied","tree":{"sha":"b7ce9a4dc4c2fb3741e0663d32ffa95f21e0786b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/b7ce9a4dc4c2fb3741e0663d32ffa95f21e0786b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/6f3fef09f82a5ecc1946171ab5ab41886d306bf6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us