ame":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T07:45:19Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"fix: Correct invalid HSL token usage in index.css\n\nReplace invalid direct HSL triplet usage with hsl() wrapper:\n- background-color: var(--background) → hsl(var(--background))\n- color: var(--foreground) → hsl(var(--foreground))\n\nHSL tokens (--background, --foreground) are defined as triplets\n(e.g., ''0 0% 100%'') and must be wrapped with hsl() to be valid CSS.\n\nSpacing tokens (--space-*) are raw numeric values and remain as-is.\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ No invalid raw HSL-triplet usage remains\n✅ App renders correctly in local dev (verified at http://localhost:3000)","tree":{"sha":"e72d02c828e1aff796a3bd6a97ae08db7b030616","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/e72d02c828e1aff796a3bd6a97ae08db7b030616"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/863a662fb9bd40e24ac476b0ad370c97ffdb9b47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","t