Helmut Lindel"},"message":"docs: Update workflow README to match actual deploy.yml implementation\n\nUpdate .github/workflows/README.md to accurately reflect deploy.yml:\n\n4-Stage Pipeline:\n1. Test - Quality checks and build validation\n2. Build - Container image build and push to GHCR\n3. Deploy GREEN - Deploy new revision (0% or 100% traffic)\n4. Verify + Switch - Health checks, smoke tests, traffic switch\n\nBranch→Environment Mapping (corrected):\n- develop → dev\n- release → staging\n- main → prod\n\nworkflow_dispatch Inputs (actual):\n- environment: auto/dev/staging/prod (default: auto)\n  - ''auto'' resolves from branch (develop→dev, release→staging, main→prod)\n- cloud: auto/azure/aws (default: auto)\n  - ''auto'' selects based on infra/ directory structure\n\nRemoved Non-Existent Inputs:\n- deploy_enabled (does not exist)\n- revision_label (does not exist)\n- initial_traffic_weight (does not exist)\n- enable_traffic_switch (does not exist)\n\nArtifact-Based Handoff:\n- Stage 3 uploads deploy-outputs.env artifact\n- Stage 4 downloads and loads GREEN_URL, GREEN_ID, BLUE_ID, ACTIVE_URL\n- Documented why artifacts vs job outputs (1MB limit, reliability)\n\nOther Corrections:\n- All branches auto-switch traffic after verification\n- Use GitHub Environment protection for manual approval\n- Automatic rollback to BLUE on verification failure\n- NPM_PACKAGE_TOKEN must be long-lived PAT (not GITHUB_TOKEN)\n- ci.yml handles PR checks (deploy.yml does not run on PRs)\n\nAcceptance criteria met:\n✅ Documentation matches YAML behavior exactly\n✅ Correct 4-stage pipeline structure\n✅ Correct branch→environment mapping\n✅ Correct workflow_dispatch inputs documented\n✅ ''auto'' behavior explained for both inputs\n✅ Removed all non-existent input references\n✅ Artifact-based handoff documented","tree":{"sha":"d3cfeaf2d9089be6f17f973d12de12d135bb081f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/d3cfeaf2d9089be6f17f973d12de12d135bb081f"},"url":"htt