rror-reporter.ts: Remove unused eslint-disable directives for console\n\nOpen-source hygiene:\n- Add MIT LICENSE file at repo root\n- Update README to reference MIT license","tree":{"sha":"c72a1524875dc845a57ca43b32767e00860118d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/c72a1524875dc845a57ca43b32767e00860118d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/09d0d6f70476277c7bed90e8e56b1e56caad1198","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/09d0d6f70476277c7bed90e8e56b1e56caad1198","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDA5ZDBkNmY3MDQ3NjI3N2M3YmVkOTBlOGU1NmIxZTU2Y2FhZDExOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917","sha":"7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917"}],"sha":"09d0d6f70476277c7bed90e8e56b1e56caad1198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/09d0d6f70476277c7bed90e8e56b1e56caad1198"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:22:15Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:22:15Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"refactor: Make remote config testable without Jest module mocking\n\nCreate env-provider abstraction that works in both Vite and Jest:\n- ViteEnvProvider: Uses import.meta.env (Vite runtime)\n- ProcessEnvProvider: Uses process.env (Jest/Node.js)\n- StaticEnvProvider: Injectable values for testing\n\nRefactor remote config to use env provider:\n- Replace direct import.meta.env access with getEnv()\n- Now testable without mocking the entire module\n- Tests can inject custom env values via StaticEnvProvider\n\nRemove Jest moduleNameMapper override:\n- No longer mock @/config/remotes\n- Tests now validate real config implementation\n- Add @/config path mapping for consistency\n\nUpdate tests:\n- Test default config behavior\n- Test env variable override behavior\n- Test partial env variable fallback\n- Use beforeEach/afterEach to save/restore provider\n\nBenefits:\n- Real config logic is tested, not a mock\n- Easy to test different env configurations\n- Works in both Vite and Jest without special handling\n- Extensible for other env-dependent configs","tree":{"sha":"0e3abbaddab74034827c54acb7f7c01ca92a2507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/0e3abbaddab74034827c54acb7f7c01ca92a2507"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKDdlM2NhMWMxY2RlNDQ2ZjRhNGVlYzAzYzAxZGM4OTk5ZTEyYmU5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/bcf4a144cceb400d1debfe0f50e52f3437372518","sha":"bcf4a144cceb400d1debfe0f50e52f3437372518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/bcf4a144cceb400d1debfe0f50e52f3437372518"}],"sha":"7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/7e3ca1c1cde446f4a4eec03c01dc8999e12be917"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/bcf4a144cceb400d1debfe0f50e52f3437372518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:18:11Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:18:11Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"fix: Improve RemoteAppMount lifecycle cleanup correctness\n\nFix issues with cleanup that could cause broken remounts:\n\n1. Always reset mountedRef regardless of unmount implementation\n   - Previously only reset if unmountFnRef existed\n   - Now always resets to allow proper remounting\n\n2. Always clear container DOM on unmount\n   - Prevents stale content from previous mount\n   - Ensures clean slate for next mount\n\n3. Add error handling for async unmount\n   - Catch and report unmount errors via error reporter\n   - Prevents silent failures during cleanup\n\n4. Unconditional cleanup in effect return\n   - Cleanup always runs, even if remote doesn''t implement unmount\n   - Guarantees container and state are reset\n\nThis ensures reliable remounting behavior and prevents ''stuck'' states\nwhere the component thinks it''s still mounted after navigation.","tree":{"sha":"e7003c09f701f561bac09dec980c2e6c4ab67230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/e7003c09f701f561bac09dec980c2e6c4ab67230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/bcf4a144cceb400d1debfe0f50e52f3437372518","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://ap