factor: Eliminate inline styles and hard-coded colors from shell UI\n\n- RemoteAppErrorBoundary: Replace inline styles with Tailwind classes\n- NotFoundPage: Replace hard-coded gray/blue colors with design tokens\n- Stub remotes: Replace hard-coded blue/green colors with design tokens\n- All shell UI now uses tokenized colors (primary, secondary, foreground, etc.)\n- Maintains consistency with design system and CSS variables\n\nChanges:\n- text-gray-* → text-foreground, text-muted-foreground\n- bg-blue-* → bg-primary, bg-primary/10\n- bg-green-* → bg-secondary, bg-secondary/10\n- bg-white → bg-card\n- border-gray-* → border-border\n- All inline style objects → Tailwind utility classes","tree":{"sha":"d34b3a641346fece26bcbcbe35586717b73a7596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/d34b3a641346fece26bcbcbe35586717b73a7596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/e945108e1fc26d7b4ae47407d4d7daa6174cccf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/e945108e1fc26d7b4ae47407d4d7daa6174cccf8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ-8TItoAKGU5NDUxMDhlMWZjMjZkN2I0YWU0NzQwN2Q0ZDdkYWE2MTc0Y2NjZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/94123e11a7ff59dccd96e95142ad593a5099c6bd","sha":"94123e11a7ff59dccd96e95142ad593a5099c6bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/94123e11a7ff59dccd96e95142ad593a5099c6bd"}],"sha":"e945108e1fc26d7b4ae47407d4d7daa6174cccf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/e945108e1fc26d7b4ae47407d4d7daa6174cccf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commits/94123e11a7ff59dccd96e95142ad593a5099c6bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:09:40Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-26T20:09:40Z","email":"helmut@amua.app","name":"Helmut Lindel"},"message":"refactor: Remove console.* from production source code\n\n- Create error-reporter abstraction (no-op by default)\n- Replace console.error in RemoteAppMount with reportError\n- Replace console.error in RemoteAppErrorBoundary with reportError\n- Add context to error reports (remoteName, basePath, componentStack)\n- ConsoleErrorReporter available for development but not used by default\n- Complies with coding standards: no console in production code\n\nThe error reporter can be wired to monitoring services (Sentry, DataDog)\nin the future without changing component code.","tree":{"sha":"f149c9a8e94995a75ca18d6c71e29f1070f17a79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/trees/f149c9a8e94995a75ca18d6c71e29f1070f17a79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amuaapps/react-app-shell/git/commits/94123e11a7ff59dccd96e95142ad593a5099c6bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226952690?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helmutamua","id":226952690,"login":"helmutamua","node_id":"U_kgDODYcF8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helmutamua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amuaapps/react-app-shell/commit/94123e11a7ff59